# Output folders that some toolchains like to use.
#
# Note the trailing wildcard: this used to say 'build' alone, which matched nothing here because the
# directories are 'build-xbox' and 'build_nxdk'. 549 build artifacts were being tracked as a result,
# 43 MB of them, and every build made a commit full of changed object files.
build
build*/
*.obj
*.xbe

# QTCreator user project file
/CMakeLists.txt.user*
CMakeSettings.json

# Visual Studio Files
.vs/
.dccache
# Relay session logs and build noise
logs/xbox/
relay_build.log

# Development leftovers that must not reach a public repo
logs/
*.log
